---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Ceres Technology | Supply Chain Intelligence" description="Ceres sits between your ERP and your critical decisions — monitoring, reconciling, and surfacing exactly where your team needs to act.">
  <main class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-start w-full">

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 px-8 border-b border-outline-variant overflow-hidden w-full">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-20">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-container/20 to-transparent"></div>
        <img width="512" height="512" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale" alt="Supply chain operations" src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/hero-automotive.jpg`} />
      </div>
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
        <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-8 flex flex-col justify-center">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] font-normal text-primary mb-4 uppercase">Supply Chain Intelligence</span>
          <h1 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none mb-8">
            Your planners spend days doing what takes us minutes.
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] max-w-prose mb-10">
            Ceres is the AI planning engine that sits between your ERP and your critical decisions — monitoring live signals, reconciling what your system says against what's actually happening, and surfacing exactly where your team needs to act.
          </p>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/") ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "book-a-demo/" : import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/book-a-demo/"} class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-8 py-4 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase hover:opacity-90 transition-all">
              Book a Demo
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Trusted By -->
    <section class="py-12 px-8 border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest w-full">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-8 opacity-60 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all">
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] font-normal text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Clients</span>
        <div class="flex gap-16 items-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-on-surface-variant font-headline tracking-[-0.01em]">Bosch</div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-on-surface-variant font-headline tracking-[-0.01em] italic">Alps Alpine</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The Problem -->
    <section class="py-24 px-8 border-b border-outline-variant w-full">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="mb-16">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] font-normal text-primary uppercase">The Challenge</span>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface mt-4">The data exists. The problem is that nobody can see it clearly.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-1 border-t border-l border-outline-variant">
          <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 p-10 border-r border-b border-outline-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors group">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-4xl mb-6">dynamic_feed</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-4">Manual Reconciliation</h3>
            <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Your ERP says one thing. Your suppliers say another. Resolving that gap falls on planners — in spreadsheets, every cycle.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 p-10 border-r border-b border-outline-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors group">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-4xl mb-6">error</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-4">Exception Overload</h3>
            <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">The 5 signals that matter are buried inside thousands of rows. Finding them takes a week. Acting on them takes another.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 p-10 border-r border-b border-outline-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors group">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-4xl mb-6">groups</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-4">Misaligned Teams</h3>
            <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Demand and supply planning run on different data. S&OP becomes a debate about whose numbers are right — not a decision meeting.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 p-10 border-r border-b border-outline-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors group">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-4xl mb-6">warning</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-4">Inventory Risk</h3>
            <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Over-committed on uncertain demand. Under-covered on real exposure. Both kill margin — and both are preventable with better visibility.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The Platform -->
    <section class="py-24 px-8 bg-surface-container-lowest overflow-hidden w-full">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end mb-20 gap-8">
          <div class="max-w-2xl">
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] font-normal text-primary uppercase">How It Works</span>
            <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface mt-4">Four layers your current stack doesn't have.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 justify-end">
              <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-primary rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] text-primary uppercase">System Health: Optimal</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-32">

          <!-- 01 Data Vault -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-5 order-2 md:order-1">
              <span class="font-mono font-light text-6xl text-on-surface-variant/30 font-headline mb-4 block">01</span>
              <h3 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] mb-6 uppercase">Data Vault</h3>
              <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] text-lg mb-8">We ingest supplier feeds, ERP exports, and market data — noisy, inconsistent, and incomplete — and reconcile them into one version of the truth. Your team stops arguing about data and starts making decisions.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-7 order-1 md:order-2">
              <div class="aspect-video bg-surface-container rounded-lg border border-outline-variant overflow-hidden p-4">
                <img loading="lazy" width="512" height="512" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded opacity-80" alt="Data reconciliation dashboard" src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/feature-dashboard.jpg`} />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 02 Exception Management -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-7">
              <div class="aspect-video bg-surface-container rounded-lg border border-outline-variant overflow-hidden relative">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-surface to-transparent opacity-60"></div>
                <img loading="lazy" width="512" height="512" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80" alt="Signal monitoring interface" src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/feature-circuit.jpg`} />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-5">
              <span class="font-mono font-light text-6xl text-on-surface-variant/30 font-headline mb-4 block">02</span>
              <h3 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] mb-6 uppercase">Exception Management</h3>
              <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] text-lg mb-8">Ceres monitors continuously and flags only what changed. Your team doesn't watch dashboards — they receive routed, prioritized signals when something demands attention.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 03 Risk Scoring -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-5 order-2 md:order-1">
              <span class="font-mono font-light text-6xl text-on-surface-variant/30 font-headline mb-4 block">03</span>
              <h3 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] mb-6 uppercase">Risk Scoring</h3>
              <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] text-lg mb-8">Every SKU, every supplier, every open PO scored against live market conditions — commodity prices, logistics delays, geopolitical events, supplier health — mapped directly to your demand plan. Not a report. A ranked action list.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-7 order-1 md:order-2">
              <div class="aspect-video bg-surface-container rounded-lg border border-outline-variant overflow-hidden">
                <img loading="lazy" width="512" height="512" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80" alt="Risk scoring interface" src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/feature-analytics.jpg`} />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 04 Scenario Modeling -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-7">
              <div class="aspect-video bg-surface-container rounded-lg border border-outline-variant overflow-hidden relative">
                <img loading="lazy" width="512" height="512" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80" alt="Scenario modeling interface" src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/feature-supply-chain.jpg`} />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-5">
              <span class="font-mono font-light text-6xl text-on-surface-variant/30 font-headline mb-4 block">04</span>
              <h3 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] mb-6 uppercase">Scenario Modeling</h3>
              <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] text-lg mb-8">Before you commit, test it. Adjust assumptions against your actual data and see the operational impact in real time. New tariffs, a supplier going down, a demand spike — stress-test your plan before it becomes a problem.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Ecosystem -->
    <section class="py-24 px-8 border-t border-outline-variant w-full">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] font-normal text-primary uppercase">System Compatibility</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface mt-4 mb-16">An intelligence layer that works alongside your existing stack</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-6 gap-8 items-center opacity-70">
          <div class="text-xl font-bold font-headline uppercase tracking-widest">SAP S/4HANA</div>
          <div class="text-xl font-bold font-headline uppercase tracking-widest">SAP IBP</div>
          <div class="text-xl font-bold font-headline uppercase tracking-widest">Oracle</div>
          <div class="text-xl font-bold font-headline uppercase tracking-widest">Kinaxis</div>
          <div class="text-xl font-bold font-headline uppercase tracking-widest">Blue Yonder</div>
          <div class="text-xl font-bold font-headline uppercase tracking-widest">Palantir</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-20 p-12 bg-surface-container-high border border-outline-variant rounded-xl max-w-4xl mx-auto relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary/20 text-9xl">hub</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-4 relative z-10">Zero Rip-and-Replace</h4>
          <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] max-w-prose mx-auto relative z-10">
            Ceres doesn't replace your ERP. It fixes the messy data and complex reconciliation logic that lives in spreadsheets, then feeds the clean plan back into your system of record.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Industries -->
    <section class="py-16 px-8 border-t border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest w-full">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="mb-10">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] font-normal text-primary uppercase">Where Ceres Runs Today</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-t border-l border-outline-variant md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
          {[
            { label: 'Pharma & Life Sciences', sub: 'API supply, delay scoring, shortage detection', path: 'pharma/' },
            { label: 'Hospitals & Health Systems', sub: 'SKU exposure, supplier risk, shortage prevention', path: 'hospitals/' },
            { label: 'Tier 1 Automotive', sub: 'OEM reconciliation, steel & aluminum, EDI gaps', path: 'tier-one/' },
            { label: 'Consumer Packaged Goods', sub: 'Demand enrichment, commodity risk, retailer signals', path: 'cpg/' },
          ].map(({ label, sub, path }) => (
            <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}${path}`} class="group border-r border-b border-outline-variant p-8 hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
              <div>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-3xl mb-4 block">arrow_forward</span>
                <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-3">{label}</h3>
                <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] text-sm">{sub}</p>
              </div>
              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.14em] text-primary uppercase group-hover:underline">See how it works →</span>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <section class="py-32 px-8 w-full" style="background-color: #011E24; background-image: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(243, 114, 33, 0.1), transparent 40%);">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] mb-8 text-primary">See Ceres work on your data in 30 minutes.</h2>
        <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] max-w-prose mx-auto mb-10">We map your ERP data to live market signals and show you exactly what's at risk — right now, in your supply chain.</p>
        <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/") ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "book-a-demo/" : import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/book-a-demo/"} class="inline-block bg-primary text-on-primary px-12 py-5 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase hover:opacity-90 transition-all shadow-xl">
          Book a Demo
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
